  "body": "Discover an exceptional opportunity to secure one of four brand-new standalone homes in a peaceful cul-de-sac at 5 Dianthus Place, Browns Bay. Located within the sought-after Rangitoto College (Rangi) school zone, these beautifully designed residences offer modern comfort, quality craftsmanship, and a choice of layouts to suit different family needs.\r\n\r\nFour Homes. Different Layouts. One Desirable Location.\r\n• Lot 1 & Lot 2: Spacious 4-bedroom homes, each featuring 2.5 bathrooms and a double internal-access garage — ideal for growing families seeking extra space and convenience.\r\n• Lot 3: A generously proportioned 139.7m² home featuring 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, a dedicated study, and a single garage. Upstairs, a stylish beverage station adds an extra touch of convenience, making this a spacious and versatile three-bedroom home.\r\n• Lot 4: A thoughtfully designed 134.5m² home offering 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, and a single garage — an excellent option for families or professionals who value comfort and practicality.\r\n\r\nQuality You Can Trust\r\n\r\nEach home comes with a 10-year Stamford Build Guarantee, providing added peace of mind for your new-home investment.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love This Location\r\n• Sought-after Rangitoto College school zone\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting with minimal through traffic\r\n• Brand-new standalone homes offering modern living\r\n• A choice of floor plans to suit different lifestyles\r\n• Convenient access to Browns Bay's shops, cafés, beaches, and everyday amenities\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, securing a quality family home, or looking for a brand-new property in a desirable North Shore location, these four homes deserve your attention.\r\n\r\nSecure your preferred home at 5 Dianthus Place, Browns Bay, and enjoy the benefits of modern living in a location families love.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange a private viewing or visit the next open home.",
